@startuml
!include style/ail.puml
title G6 · Resource states: one synthetic immutable Store
top to bottom direction
skinparam roundcorner 18
hide empty description
state "No owned handle\nCaller has no destruction obligation" as absent
state "Live Store\nCaller holds one destruction obligation" as live
state "destroy is active\nCallee has taken the obligation at entry" as destroying
state "Destroyed Store\nObligation discharged; dependent borrows invalid" as dead
absent -[bold]-> live : create returns non-null and gives owned result
absent -[bold]-> absent : create returns null; creates no obligation
live -[bold]-> live : view borrows; preserves the caller's obligation
live -[bold]-> destroying : destroy consumes the handle at entry
destroying -[bold]-> dead : destruction invalidates borrows before destroy returns
legend bottom
  Rounded box = resource/obligation state; bold arrow = labelled state transition.
  Self-loop = the obligation state is preserved. Arrows are not runtime messages.
  Borrowing grants access and creates no extra destruction obligation.
  Non-normative: C2, C3, C5; synthetic buffers example only.
  No constructed prepare/read_prepared ordering and no reference-counted lifecycle.
endlegend
@enduml
